{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30407","headline":"寄浔阳赵校书 · 赵嘏","name":"寄浔阳赵校书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帘下秋江夜影空，倚楼人在月明中。\n不将行止问朝列，唯脱衣裳与钓翁。\n几处别巢悲去燕，十年回首送归鸿。\n那应更结庐山社，见说心闲胜远公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30407.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30407","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}